: false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225061069", "author": {"steamid": "76561199447033286", "personaname": "sHARKO0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SHARKO0/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 210, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1, "playtime_at_review": 76, "last_played": 1791045855, "avatar": "8679a638ae1f8c4fb4003166da3b2acdd667cc3f"}, "language": "english", "review": "it`s a fun alien shooting game you can play with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1778271835, "timestamp_updated": 1778271835, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225005600", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079870574", "personaname": "Numb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079870574/", "num_games_owned": 2509, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 1168, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1168, "last_played": 1771614157, "avatar": "8b47d31a8e4011d318ab2ecbd55a1f7a760744fd"}, "language": "english", "review": "👽🔫 Alien Swarm Review 🔫👽\r\n\r\n🕹 Length: 4–6 hours (campaign) | More with replaying higher difficulties\r\n💰 Price vs. Content: Good value, especially considering it’s free\r\n⚙ Optimization: Excellent; lightweight and runs smoothly on most systems\r\n🎮 Difficulty: Moderate to hard; teamwork becomes essential on higher difficulties\r\n\r\n🎮 Gameplay\r\n\r\nAlien Swarm is a top-down cooperative shooter focused on teamwork, positioning, and surviving waves of deadly aliens. Inspired by classic sci-fi action films, the game puts players in the role of elite marines completing missions aboard infested facilities and colonies.\r\n\r\nThe game is clearly designed around 4-player co-op, and that’s where it becomes the most fun. Each player can choose a specific class — Officer, Special Weapons, Medic, or Tech — encouraging coordination and role distribution during missions. Playing solo is possible with AI companions, but the experience is far less enjoyable compared to playing with friends.\r\n\r\nGameplay revolves around completing objectives while fighting off increasingly aggressive alien swarms. Turrets, welding doors shut, managing ammo, and covering teammates create tense moments, especially on higher difficulties.\r\n\r\nHowever, despite being fun in co-op, the game can become repetitive after a while. The campaign is relatively short, enemy variety is limited, and progression systems are fairly simple compared to modern co-op shooters.\r\n\r\n✅ The Good:\r\n✔ Fun and chaotic 4-player co-op gameplay\r\n✔ Strong teamwork mechanics and class variety\r\n✔ Smooth controls and satisfying shooting\r\n✔ Great atmosphere inspired by classic sci-fi horror\r\n✔ Completely free\r\n\r\n❌ The Bad:\r\n✖ Repetitive gameplay loop over time\r\n✖ Limited enemy and mission variety\r\n✖ Solo play isn’t very engaging\r\n✖ Relatively short overall experience\r\n\r\n💻 Technical Aspects\r\n\r\n🎨 Graphics: Simple but effective visuals with good lighting and effects\r\n🎶 Sound: Solid sci-fi atmosphere and satisfying weapon sounds\r\n🐞 Bugs: Very stable overall\r\n\r\n⭐ Final Verdict\r\n\r\nAlien Swarm is a fun and well-made cooperative shooter that shines when played with friends. The class system and teamwork mechanics create enjoyable moments, especially during chaotic fights, but the repetitive structure and limited content keep it from reaching a higher level.\r\n\r\nStill, for a free co-op game, it’s absolutely worth trying — especially with a full squad.\r\n\r\n👉 Rating: 7.5/10 👽", "timestamp_created": 1778206867, "timestamp_updated": 1778206867, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520547926425933838", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "hardware": {"system_ram": "31914", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 9600X 6-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 9060 XT", "vram_size": 16200}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224804505", "author": {"steamid": "76561199234473095", "personaname": "Lost in your Walls", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199234473095/", "num_games_owned": 162, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 892, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 770, "deck_playtime_at_review": 770, "last_played": 1778633582, "avatar": "b94ce80344cf07941465485c9f5b848f76fc41cf"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Aliens Swarmed 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1777955167, "timestamp_updated": 1777955167, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224630452", "author": {"steamid": "76561199102487068", "personaname": "besgashi27", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199102487068/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 218, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 208, "last_played": 1783711670, "avatar": "0bf3f5389b39bd1182fe8692dc5eff2a93e5b53c"}, "language": "english", "review": "cant run\n\nwould recommend", "timestamp_created": 1777760321, "timestamp_updated": 1777760321, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weig